breed, or temperament.\"}}]\n75:[\"$\",\"p\",\"86\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Barky Bark</strong> — This name has a timeless quality that works for pets of any age, breed, or temperament.\"}}]\n76:[\"$\",\"p\",\"87\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Chairman Meow</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n77:[\"$\",\"p\",\"88\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Bark Ruffalo</strong> — Inspired by pop culture, this name works great for pets that have a dramatic flair or star quality.\"}}]\n78:[\"$\",\"p\",\"89\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>The Great Catsby</strong> — This playful name is perfect for a pet with a big personality and a love for attention.\"}}]\n79:[\"$\",\"p\",\"90\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Pawdrey Hepburn</strong> — This name captures the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day.\"}}]\n7a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"91\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Alex Trebek</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm.\"}}]\n7b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"92\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Dogzilla</strong> — This playful name is perfect for a pet with a big personality and a love for attention.\"}}]\n7c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"93\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Gandalf the Greyhound</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm.\"}}]\n7d:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"94